I've made a first-draft deck of the Smart.fm import for Anki. You can get it
at:
http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=795&download=y

It's in alphabetical order, not frequency order as the lesson is, but it's a
starting place. The filename for the audio is in the tag for each entry.

